    {
      "status": "resolved",
      "issue": "A nowrap earned-history strip hid most of a completed route behind a scrollbar suppressed on narrow layouts.",
      "evidence": "The inspected baseline image cuts off the first relationship. Independent final captures show complete Cluj–Salina–Cheile–Apuseni and Eminescu–Academia–Maiorescu routes at 320px with 32px root text, including the 33-character geography caption. All text wraps inside the 262px trail without internal horizontal or vertical clipping."
    },
    {
      "status": "pass",
      "check": "Source scope",
      "evidence": "The screen diff only assigns dedicated step/relation classes and removes relation nowrap. Lanț-only wrapping, shrink bounds and word wrapping override the shared mobile strip. No action, state, focus ticket, persistence hook, score or semantic markup changed."
    },
    {
      "status": "pass",
      "check": "Keyboard and persistence",
      "evidence": "Tab reached the trail and displayed a visible focus outline. ArrowRight did not send a request or alter local storage. Space activated a real first-hop choice once; Enter completed subsequent moves. Reload after an active first hop preserved the same game ID, path and move count with no POST. One literature journey also exercised undo and replay."
    },
    {
      "status": "pass",
      "check": "Terminal layout and behavior",
